# The image is built from the Go module alone. Everything below is either a
# build output or a separate toolchain's tree, and none of it reaches the
# binary; leaving it out keeps the build context small and keeps a stale
# local binary from ever being mistaken for the one the image built.
.git
/bfinger
/dist
/build
host/node_modules
host/dist
host/bundle
tools/walletd/walletd
tools/mintprobe/mintprobe
**/*.test
**/*.out
